FreeCORE release delta — freebsd-src
================================

FreeCORE carries the TrueNAS® CORE 13.3 system forward as an independently
maintained operating system on FreeBSD. It is not affiliated with or endorsed
by iXsystems, Inc. Thanks to the FreeNAS and TrueNAS contributors whose
open-source work made this possible.


Upstream lineage
----------------

This repository publishes the FreeCORE release delta against freebsd/freebsd-src. It
does not republish that upstream repository or the private development commit
chronology. The README identifies the base and credits the contributors whose
work is represented in the delta.


